WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.540
One of the things that news stations are supposed
to do is that you're not supposed to use bogus

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.300
pictures or video reports.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.990
And Fox News has been caught doing exactly
that.

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:18.300
This has to do with the Seattle Capitol Hill
autonomous zone abbreviated or of the acronym

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.140
is Char's S.H.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:25.220
Azy, which has sort of formed in the aftermath
of the nationwide protests of late.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:30.480
And this is one of the clearest and most undeniable
violations of just basic journalistic ethical

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:32.600
standards that you can imagine.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:40.040
On Friday, they were, of course, running stories
constantly on their Web site about the chads.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:44.620
This is an area near Seattle's Capitol Hill
where protesters took over a few blocks after

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:46.230
police left the area.

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:50.550
And for much of the day, Fox News's Web site
was running pictures of a guy with a long

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:55.190
gun, some kind of protective vest, a beanie
and a green mask standing in front of an old

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:57.110
navy with the window smashed out.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:02.500
Now, this was a completely fabricated what
we would call a collage image.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:03.500
This scene that

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.740
was pictured on the Fox News Web site didn't
happen.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:12.890
It was a combination of a Getty image photo
of a guy with a gun who was at the process

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:18.780
protest zone on June 10th, meaning last Wednesday
with an image from last month of a smashed

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:19.900
window.

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:23.770
And the entire collage was completely and
totally fake.

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:26.930
Now, this wasn't just one fake image they
used.

00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:33.830
Another one had the same gunman with the green
mask, with the long gun appearing to stand

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:39.320
at the start of the chars, sort of placing
him almost like he was an armed sentry to

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:40.320
that area.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.409
Now, think what you want about the Char's.

00:01:42.409 --> 00:01:47.479
The guy in the green mask was not actually
doing what the pictures suggested he was doing.

00:01:47.479 --> 00:01:49.120
It was totally and completely fake.

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:53.630
These were doctored images when The Seattle
Times told Fox News.

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.060
Fox News quietly pulled the

00:01:55.060 --> 00:02:01.320
pictures when they were pressed by e-mail,
they said, We have replaced our photo illustration

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:06.890
with the clearly delineated images of a gunman
and a shattered store front, both of which

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:11.150
were taken this week in Seattle's autonomous
zone.

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:17.340
Except that explanation is also untrue because
the gunman photo was taken on June 10th.

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:21.710
The storefront image with a broken window
was from May 30th.

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:24.240
So it was not taken from this week.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:26.350
This week being last week.

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:28.890
But this still isn't the full story.

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:33.569
For a while on Fox News's Web site, there
was an image of a building burning right above

00:02:33.569 --> 00:02:37.160
a bunch of stories about protests in Seattle.

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:39.849
Remember that Friday was June 12th.

00:02:39.849 --> 00:02:45.410
The stories about Seattle that do all of the
stories below the image are about Seattle.

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:51.380
And yet the picture that they're showing was
